usage: test_atomic_mutation_runner.py [-h] --repo REPO [--runner RUNNER]
                                      --out OUT [--case CASE]

Exercise the mutation runner's CLI against real temporary Lean computations.
No subprocess is mocked. The temporary repository links installed dependency
packages and has its own isolated git metadata. All fixtures/logs stay outside
the source repository. Exit 0 means every nonempty control has the expected
classification; exit 1 means an observed classification differs; exit 3 means
the harness could not run.

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --runner RUNNER
  --out OUT
  --case CASE      Run only these named controls
